				<textElement textAlignment="Center" verticalAlignment="Top">
					<font size="7"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Raha misy fiatoana amin’ny asa dia tsy maintsy ampiarahina amin’ity filazana loza ity, ao anaty valopy mihidy, ny taratasy fandraisan-karama ho an’ny volana mialohan’ny nitrangan’ny loza na kopian’ny fifanarahan’asa raha mbola tsy ampy iray volana no niasana  ]]></text>
